{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/MengTo/status/2104565735288938804","id":"2104565735288938804","text":"I made this holographic card with Opus 5.5 by combining 2D artwork with 3D objects.\n\nI used multiple PNG layers with a depth map skill then added 3D elements like the sword and card extrusion. That combination gives the card its depth.\n\nMaking the best holographic card I can has been one of my side quests. I think this is it.\n\nLive site: http://threeui.com/dark-souls-holo-card\n\nMy 3D skills are open source: http://github.com/mengto/skills","raw_text":{"text":"I made this holographic card with Opus 5.5 by combining 2D artwork with 3D objects.\n\nI used multiple PNG layers with a depth map skill then added 3D elements like the sword and card extrusion. That combination gives the card its depth.\n\nMaking the best holographic card I can has been one of my side quests. I think this is it.\n\nLive site: https://t.co/thc089IQcX\n\nMy 3D skills are open source: https://t.co/bfFOBWRcgl","display_text_range":[0,418],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[280,303],"id":"2104553764506255361","display":"pic.x.com/nK8Ogl5Gku","original":"https://t.co/nK8Ogl5Gku","replacement":"https://x.com/MengTo/status/2104565735288938804/video/1"},{"type":"url","indices":[340,363],"original":"https://t.co/thc089IQcX","replacement":"http://threeui.com/dark-souls-holo-card","display":"threeui.com/dark-souls-hol…"},{"type":"url","indices":[395,418],"original":"https://t.co/bfFOBWRcgl","replacement":"http://github.com/mengto/skills","display":"github.com/mengto/skills"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"MengTo","url":"https://x.com/MengTo","id":"5797422","followers":188540,"following":465,"likes":40606,"media_count":1533,"name":"Meng To","description":"Founder at @designcodeio and http://aura.build. I teach designers code and developers design.\n\nMy three.js templates: http://threeui.com","raw_description":{"text":"Founder at @designcodeio and https://t.co/Kpiogf225W. I t